"Tá aistriúchán in easnamh sa chomhad XLIFF don deighleog ábhair riachtanach"
" %s. Críochnaigh an t-aonad sin agus iompórtáil an pacáiste arís."

#: includes/class-ymulti-xliff-exchange.php:243
msgid ""
"The XLIFF file is missing the YMulti job identity or source snapshot. "
"Export a fresh package from this job, then import that package."
msgstr ""
"Tá aitheantas phoist YMulti nó léargas den fhoinse in easnamh sa chomhad "
"XLIFF. Easpórtáil pacáiste úr ón bpost seo agus iompórtáil é."

#: includes/class-ymulti-xliff-exchange.php:266
msgid ""
"The XLIFF file must contain a translated title and every required content "
"segment. Complete those units, then import the package again."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór teideal aistrithe agus gach deighleog ábhair riachtanach a bheith sa"
" chomhad XLIFF. Críochnaigh na haonaid sin agus iompórtáil an pacáiste "
"arís."

#: includes/class-ymulti-xliff-exchange.php:82
msgid "The XLIFF file requires readable XML content."
msgstr "Ní mór ábhar XML inléite a bheith sa chomhad XLIFF."

#: includes/class-ymulti-xliff-exchange.php:229
msgid "The XLIFF payload exceeds the 5 MB safety limit."
msgstr "Sáraíonn an t-ualach XLIFF an teorainn sábháilteachta 5 MB."

#: includes/class-ypm-media-localization.php:375
msgid "The attachment changed after Vision review. Run the review again."
msgstr ""
"Athraíodh an ceangaltán tar éis athbhreithniú Vision. Rith an "
"t-athbhreithniú arís."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-site-plan.php:254
msgid ""
"The connected Yablonsky AI text route must pass the current live canary "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór don bhealach téacs Yablonsky AI nasctha pas a fháil sa tástáil "
"tháscach bheo reatha ar dtús."

#: includes/class-ypm-integrity-audit.php:191
msgid ""
"The connected workspace currently projects one or fewer models. Refresh the"
" account and verify workspace plan entitlements if a wider catalog is "
"expected."
msgstr ""
"Ní thaispeánann an spás oibre nasctha ach samhail amháin nó níos lú faoi "
"láthair. Athnuaigh an cuntas agus seiceáil ceadanna phlean an spáis oibre "
"má táthar ag súil le catalóg níos fairsinge."

#: includes/class-ypm-admin.php:955
msgid "The enabled-locale order now drives YMulti frontend switchers and dropdowns."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn ord na logchaighdeáin cumasaithe lascthóirí teanga agus liostaí "
"anuas an chomhéadain phoiblí YMulti anois."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:2215
msgid ""
"The encryption method used for the stored API key is unavailable. Reconnect"
" the account."
msgstr ""
"Níl an modh criptithe a úsáideadh don eochair API stóráilte ar fáil. "
"Athnasc an cuntas."

#: includes/class-ypm-integrity-audit.php:88
msgid ""
"The export contains IDs, taxonomy/post-type names and consistency states. "
"API keys and AI credentials stay in protected settings."
msgstr ""
"Tá aitheantais, ainmneacha tacsanomaíochta/cineálacha post agus staideanna "
"comhsheasmhachta san easpórtáil. Fanann eochracha API agus dintiúir AI sna "
"socruithe cosanta."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1632
msgid "The final AI document requires translated content."
msgstr "Teastaíonn ábhar aistrithe ón doiciméad deiridh AI."

#: includes/class-ypm-media-localization.php:321
msgid "The generated image URL requires a safe HTTPS URL."
msgstr "Ní mór URL sábháilte HTTPS a úsáid don íomhá ghinte."

#: includes/class-ypm-media-localization.php:341
msgid ""
"The generated image did not pass Media Library validation. Choose another "
"image model or revise the generation request, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Níor éirigh leis an íomhá ghinte seiceáil Leabharlann na Meán a rith. "
"Roghnaigh samhail íomhánna eile nó athraigh an t-iarratas ginte, ansin bain"
" triail eile as."

#: includes/class-ypm-translation-glossary.php:71
msgid ""
"The glossary guides future AI output while existing human translations "
"remain authoritative."
msgstr ""
"Treoraíonn an ghluais aschur AI amach anseo, agus fanann na haistriúcháin "
"dhaonna atá ann cheana údarásach."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-admin.php:87
msgid ""
"The key travels only to ai.yablonsky.io, is stored encrypted with this "
"WordPress installation's keys, and appears as a masked value after saving. "
"Local multilingual features remain independent of AI."
msgstr ""
"Ní sheoltar an eochair ach chuig ai.yablonsky.io; stóráiltear í criptithe "
"le heochracha na suiteála WordPress seo agus taispeántar í i bhfolach tar "
"éis sábhála. Fanann feidhmeanna ilteangacha áitiúla neamhspleách ar AI."

#: includes/class-ymulti-autopilot.php:768
msgid ""
"The launch plan summarizes the active scope. Save keeps the configuration "
"ready for later; Launch stores the plan, scans the current scope, prepares "
"the backlog and starts continuous background processing."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an plean seolta achoimre ar an raon gníomhach. Coinníonn Sábháil an"
" chumraíocht réidh le haghaidh níos déanaí; stórálann Seol an plean, "
"scanann sé an raon reatha, ullmhaíonn sé an riaráiste agus tosaíonn sé "
"próiseáil leanúnach sa chúlra."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:908
msgid "The local image file path requires a readable WordPress attachment."
msgstr "Teastaíonn ceangaltán WordPress inléite ón gcosán comhaid íomhá áitiúil."

#: includes/compat/class-ypm-compat-woo.php:213
msgid ""
"The locale dictionary will be reused from request memory after its first "
"load."
msgstr ""
"Athúsáidfear foclóir an logchaighdeáin ó chuimhne na hiarrata tar éis a "
"chéad lódála."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php:193
msgid ""
"The localized page changed the protected HTML/JavaScript/CSS structure. "
"YMulti rejected the draft and preserved the source structure."
msgstr ""
"D'athraigh an leathanach logánaithe struchtúr cosanta HTML/JavaScript/CSS. "
"Dhiúltaigh YMulti don dréacht agus chaomhnaigh sé struchtúr na foinse."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1328
msgid ""
"The localized response changed content outside detected human-language "
"regions. YMulti rejected the draft and preserved the source structure."
msgstr ""
"D'athraigh an freagra logánaithe ábhar lasmuigh de na réigiúin teanga "
"dhaonna a braitheadh. Dhiúltaigh YMulti don dréacht agus chaomhnaigh sé "
"struchtúr na foinse."

#: includes/compat/class-ypm-compat-woo.php:318
msgid ""
"The native WooCommerce translation remains active until you save an "
"override."
msgstr ""
"Fanann an t-aistriúchán dúchasach WooCommerce gníomhach go dtí go sábhálann"
" tú sárú."

#: includes/class-ymulti-localized-bases.php:167
msgid ""
"The native WordPress rewrite base stays active for locales with a blank "
"field. Localization applies to public content routes, while wp-admin, REST "
"and system paths keep their native paths."
msgstr ""
"Fanann an bunainmneach athscríofa dúchasach WordPress gníomhach do "
"logchaighdeáin a bhfuil réimse bán acu. Baineann an logánú le bealaí ábhair"
" phoiblí, ach coimeádann wp-admin, REST agus cosáin chórais a "
"ngnáthchosáin."

#: includes/class-ypm-admin-terms.php:67
msgid ""
"The new term remains an independent WordPress taxonomy object for this "
"locale."
msgstr ""
"Fanann an téarma nua ina réad tacsanomaíochta WordPress neamhspleách don "
"logchaighdeán seo."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1244
msgid "The next translation stage is ready when the AI safety budget refreshes."
msgstr ""
"Beidh an chéad chéim aistriúcháin eile réidh nuair a athnuafar buiséad "
"sábháilteachta AI."

#: includes/compat/class-ypm-compat-woo.php:300
msgid ""
"The original WooCommerce attribute label remains active until you save a "
"localized override."
msgstr ""
"Fanann lipéad bunaidh tréithe WooCommerce gníomhach go dtí go sábhálann tú "
"sárú logánaithe."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-admin.php:190
msgid ""
"The selected route must be enabled by the workspace plan before the canary "
"can run."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór don phlean spáis oibre an bealach roghnaithe a chumasú sula "
"bhféadfar an tástáil tháscach a rith."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1677
msgid ""
"The selected text model stream ended before a usable message response "
"arrived. WordPress content remains unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Tháinig deireadh le sruth na samhla téacs roghnaithe sula bhfuarthas "
"freagra teachtaireachta inúsáidte. Níor athraíodh ábhar WordPress."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php:74
msgid ""
"The source HTML contains an unterminated script or style element. Complete "
"the markup, then start AI translation."
msgstr ""
"Tá eilimint script nó style gan dúnadh san HTML foinse. Comhlánaigh an "
"mharcáil, ansin cuir tús le haistriúchán AI."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php:46
msgid ""
"The source HTML contains an unterminated tag or quoted attribute. Complete "
"the markup, then start AI translation."
msgstr ""
"Tá clib nó tréith idir chomharthaí athfhriotail gan dúnadh san HTML foinse."
" Comhlánaigh an mharcáil, ansin cuir tús le haistriúchán AI."

#: includes/class-ymulti-xliff-exchange.php:94
msgid ""
"The source changed after this XLIFF package was created. Export a fresh "
"package before importing to prevent stale translations from overwriting "
"newer source content."
msgstr ""
"Athraíodh an fhoinse tar éis an pacáiste XLIFF seo a chruthú. Easpórtáil "
"pacáiste úr roimh iompórtáil ionas nach scríobhfar aistriúcháin as dáta "
"thar ábhar foinse níos nuaí."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-content-segments.php:116
msgid ""
"The source contains overlapping localization regions. AI translation was "
"stopped to protect the page structure."
